{"content":"{\n  \"chapter_contract_id\": \"contract:v2-n-2-2-1:v2\",\n  \"node_id\": \"v2_n_2_2_1\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\n  \"blocks\": [\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_2_2_1:product-identity-and-profile\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究药物为合成药Y。本章应以当前产品权威（含版本与定位）确认其研发代号、通用名、化学名等身份信息，并说明剂型、规格、理化性质等适用特征；【待补充：研究药物的当前产品权威版本与来源定位：该项待研究团队确认后补充】；【待补充：研究药物的剂型、规格、理化性质等产品特征：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_2_2_1:structure-applicability\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"化学结构与分子式适用性应给出明确结论（是否适用）及理由；未确认前不得默认套用结构式或分子式描述。研究药物合成药Y的化学结构/分子式适用性结论为：【待补充：化学结构/分子式适用性结论及理由：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"block_id\": \"blk:v2_n_2_2_1:mechanism\",\n      \"kind\": \"paragraph\",\n      \"text\": \"研究药物的作用机制为继承性义务，应由本章作声明的实质补充，并标明证据来源；现有来源未提供本药作用机制表述，不得以同类药机制照抄替代。应说明合成药Y的作用机制及其证据来源：【待补充：研究药物的作用机制及其证据来源：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [],\n      \"source_locator\": \"\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"e000a9d6542f828054f3c6c5f6341a73e989365f76152ef3ee870e2d0f778adc"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:dbea952c65096ca261f12dcce9ec622f7836ea089dfe380597fabab2971569f1:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:dbea952c65096ca261f12dcce9ec622f7836ea089dfe380597fabab2971569f1:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"d7aa71e24f6a268d68388d01524214426f9bbf2efdb8c84544b075fbef702802","prompt_sha256":"5322c0235bbedc2213b004747cbd757992154e907fd360b9bf7be0e09db8863e","provider_session_id":"9bd1089f-c98c-4673-a008-617e32938438","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},